{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的个别音乐术语和比喻（如“马祖卡味”“F小调”“圣咏”）对普通观众不够直观，X的叙事因果解释更充分、更容易直接理解。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的核心优势是话语与感受交替呈现，重点词放大后，观众能迅速抓住人物此刻的处境，再通过随音乐出现的细小感受理解情绪如何变化。尤其是S03、S06、S07、S13，感受不只是给情绪贴标签，还呈现了声音、节奏、身体反应和心理转折，前后有呼应，能让人听出人物从怀念、动摇到带着遗憾继续生活的过程。X的优势是叙事解释更完整，个别地方更容易理解人物为什么这样想、为什么这样做，但右侧感受容易变成一组同时摆出的词，缺少Y那种随音乐展开的层次。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "284d73d5-eb13-4709-a9eb-fa3c15346837", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T232159705007Z", "elapsed_seconds": 62.922, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T23:23:02.647037+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "26a25c4378033d17633780b888d642ce88316a15723b16d5e1c457eba2198db6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc422